ath><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>SS</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>SS</mtext><mi>N</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> gives a\ntest of the remaining nonadditivity.</p>","file":"ch16-multiway-layouts/01-additive.html"}